{
 "_README": "Julius Jolly on the radio in the Backrooms. Recorded by Marius only (never TTS). ids bj_01..; audio voice/backrooms/<id>.m4a, listed in have[]; text shows on screen until then. dark:true = sinister lines: Julius drops the cheer, low, slow, close to the mic.",
 "speaker": "Julius Jolly",
 "have": [],
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "bj_01",
   "text": "Downtown FM, ninety-nine point nine. The only station in here."
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_02",
   "text": "Good morning! It is... it says morning. The clock has said morning for quite some time."
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_03",
   "text": "Julius Jolly with you. If you can hear this, please phone in. Nobody has phoned in since the carpet started."
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_04",
   "text": "I know which way you're facing.",
   "dark": true
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_05",
   "text": "The weather today is yellow. Tomorrow, expect more yellow."
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_06",
   "text": "A traffic update. There is no traffic. There are no roads. Do take care."
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_07",
   "text": "You've been in here before. You didn't leave that time either.",
   "dark": true
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_08",
   "text": "We have a request from a listener. It's from you. You asked me not to say your name."
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_09",
   "text": "Someone is knocking on my studio door. I haven't got a studio door."
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_10",
   "text": "If you've seen a green door, listeners, go through it. Don't wait for the song to finish."
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_11",
   "text": "Don't sit down to dinner. The fourth chair is taken.",
   "dark": true
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_12",
   "text": "That noise behind you is perfectly normal. Please don't check."
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_13",
   "text": "It isn't looking for you. It's already found you. It's only being polite.",
   "dark": true
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_14",
   "text": "I've counted the ceiling lights again. There's one fewer. There's always one fewer."
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_15",
   "text": "Sigrid's gingerbread recipe. Flour, syrup, ginger, and do not answer if the oven says hello."
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_16",
   "text": "Your friend out there has someone walking beside them. It looks a lot like you.",
   "dark": true
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_17",
   "text": "I can hear you walking. Could you walk a little quieter? It can hear you too."
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_18",
   "text": "Shhh. Hold your breath. Now tell me who's still breathing.",
   "dark": true
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_19",
   "text": "Chris. Martin. Which one of you is that? Only one of you came in."
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_20",
   "text": "I'm not in a studio, am I? There's no window. There's no door. There's just you, listening.",
   "dark": true
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_21",
   "text": "Right. Nobody is panicking. I am not panicking. I am simply getting under the desk."
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_22",
   "text": "When the lights go out this time, I would not run. They like it when you run.",
   "dark": true
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_23",
   "text": "We're all so happy you're staying.",
   "dark": true
  },
  {
   "id": "bj_24",
   "text": "This has been Julius Jolly, on Downtown FM. I'll be here when you come back."
  }
 ],
